flowchart TB
 TASKS["Parallel task worktrees"] --> GROUP["Task or grouped PRs<br/>to repository feature branches"]
 GROUP --> FIX["Checks and selected review source<br/>resolve every actionable finding"]
 FIX --> IMPLEMENT["Feature implementation complete<br/>including required docs and verification"]
 IMPLEMENT --> FINALS["Final PR to main in every affected repository"]
 FINALS --> ALL{"All final heads pass<br/>checks and reviews?"}
 ALL -- No --> FIXFINAL["Repair and refresh affected head evidence"]
 FIXFINAL --> ALL
 ALL -- Yes --> BARRIER["Persist readiness barrier and dependency order"]
 BARRIER --> MERGE["Recheck authority and heads<br/>merge next dependency"]
 MERGE --> MORE{"More repositories?"}
 MORE -- Yes --> RECHECK["Revalidate barrier after any code change"]
 RECHECK --> MERGE
 MORE -- No --> DONE["All merges observed<br/>feature complete"]
 DONE --> CLEAN["Owned worktree / local branch cleanup"]
 DONE --> RELEASE["Separate release / deployment tracking<br/>Ask me by default"]
 MERGE -. Unusual unresolved failure .-> HOLD["Hold affected delivery and dependents"]
